On the underlying research
--------------------------

FusionOpt is an original implementation that composes algorithms described
in several research papers (Muon, NorMuon, MONA, KL-Shampoo, Schedule-Free,
ScheduleFree+, SF-NorMuon — see docs/references.md). Algorithms described
in academic papers are not themselves subject to copyright; only the
specific text and code expressing them are. The code in this repository
is an independent reimplementation written from the papers' descriptions
and is dedicated to the public domain as described above.

If you build on this work, citing the underlying papers is good academic
practice but is not required by this license. Citing this repository is
likewise appreciated but not required.
